Package: admboundary.molit
Type: Package
Title: Download Korean Administrative Boundaries as Shapefiles
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Derick S.", "Park", email = "soonmai@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Downloads Korean administrative boundary polygons and saves
    them as shapefiles. Legal-district boundaries (시도, 시군구, 읍면동, 리)
    come from the Ministry of Land, Infrastructure and Transport (MOLIT)
    'VWorld' WFS service, which is listed on the public data portal as
    dataset 15059008 and needs a 'VWorld' API key. The service returns at
    most 2,000 features per query, so requests are split automatically by
    district-code range. Administrative-district (행정동) boundaries come
    from the 'SGIS' boundary file on the public data portal (dataset
    15129688), which needs no key.
